        "notes": "Covers: every template row maps back to its report ref (ref order, bogus ref warns); filled round trip; atomic refusal incl. repeated findings; stdin (and non-blocking stdin); complete marker; a two-commit range gets one write per commit (notes ref gains 2 commits); hostile files."
